{
  "//": "POLARITY - tap to flip the ball between attract and repel. Two fixed magnets are the only thing that moves you. Reach the goal ring, avoid the hazard.",
  "//state": "pol is +1 (attract, blue) or -1 (repel, red) and flips on the tap edge: pol * ifElse(1, -1, edge). Every force term is multiplied by it, so one variable inverts the whole field.",
  "//engine": "Expressions cap at 32 RPN tokens, so the two magnet forces are summed into ax/ay first and the velocity equation reads those. ifElse(falseValue, trueValue, condition) reads its condition LAST, and every equation reads the previous frame's values.",
  "header": {
    "apiLevel": 7,
    "width": 400,
    "height": 400,
    "profiles": 513,
    "contentDescription": "Polarity: tap to switch between attract and repel and ride the magnetic field to the goal"
  },
